"\n"
"- `Gray Matter Logic <https://www.graymatterlogic.com>`__:\n"
"\n"
"  - Maxime Chambreuil <maxime.chambreuil@graymatterlogic.com>\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
".. |maintainer-max3903| image:: https://github.com/max3903.png?size=40px\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/max3903\n"
"    :alt: max3903\n"
